{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>今日（19日）晚上6時許，警方接獲銅鑼灣勿地臣街1號時代廣場一間豐澤負責人報案，指上址有61部相機及55個相機鏡頭不翼而飛，總值約188萬元，懷疑被人盜去。警方初步調查，懷疑疑犯是一名年約40歲男子，為豐澤職員。案件列盜竊，交由灣仔警區刑事調查隊第七隊跟進，暫未有人被捕。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T15:59:46.022311+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T14:18:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T10:37:14.375832+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T15:53:11.771587+00:00","content_hash":"bd7cf9531816e41a0cb42d9db698e499126a1bb7d2e1a1b1bd47384d90832ed0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T15:59:46.022311+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}